/* ---------- Mail ----------
   Notices from Polaris staff (Crew Management, Flight Operations, Training …), written on the EFB server's admin page
   and read here like an iPad mailbox. A message goes to all pilots, or to one pilot: the EFB server knows who is
   signed in (Login with vAMSYS) and sends only the pilot's own messages; which ones were read or moved to Trash
   is kept on this device. Checked when the EFB opens, every 5 minutes, and when Mail is opened; the home-screen icon
   shows the unread count.
   Pilots can also write to a department (the admin's Inbox, staff answer there), at most 20 messages a day (see the
   Worker's pm.js). Writing to other pilots' online flights was removed (Nov 2026): older conversations between pilots
   can still be read but not answered. Conversations come as "th:<id>" rows mixed into the same mailboxes; whether a conversation was read is kept on the server, so it is the same on every device. */
